      "1566420421858": {
        "type": "feature-row",
        "settings": {
          "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2-Million-Raised-in-2022.png",
          "layout": "left",
          "title": "",
          "text": "<p>In 2022, we helped schools raise over $2,000,000 for their Students and Programs!<\/p><p><\/p><p>This year, we are looking to help more schools raise funds that truly make a difference, all while being a healthy, fun addition to your school. <\/p><p><\/p><p>Frosty Fruit Fundraiser Highlights:<br\/>• Average School Raised over $5,000 in Profit Last Year<br\/>• Meets USDA Smart Snack Guidelines<br\/>• Large Variety of Flavors<br\/>• Support to ensure your fundraiser is a success!<\/p><p><\/p><p>If you would like a free fundraiser consultation click the button below. <br\/> <\/p>",
          "button_label": "Bring Frosty Fruit to Your School!",
          "button_link": "shopify:\/\/pages\/frosty-fruit-fundraising-consultation"
        }
      },
      "1566581796738": {
        "type": "quotes",
        "blocks": {
          "1566581796738-0": {
            "type": "quote",
            "settings": {
              "quote": "<p>Frosty Fruit has a great fundraising program. I have been using them in high school for over 5 years now and have had great success. The product meets all school nutritional guidelines and students love them! Awesome customer service. <br\/><br\/>Rob and Sam have been great to work with and accommodate all of my needs. Highly recommend!!!<\/p>",
              "author": "Carl H. Wausau, WI"
            }
          },
          "1566581796738-1": {
            "type": "quote",
            "settings": {
              "quote": "<p>From the quality of product to the customer service, Frosty Fruit has gone above and beyond to help make our experience amazing. Our high school students love Frosty Fruit and it is by far our most profitable item sold in our school store! It doesn't matter if it is warm or cold weather, our students purchase Frosty Fruit slushies all school year.<\/p>",
              "author": "Jenna N. Danielsville, GA"
            }
          },
          "1566581796738-2": {
            "type": "quote",
            "settings": {
              "quote": "<p>As an Athletic Director this is by far one of the best fundraisers I have found. I have been selling Frosty Fruit slushies for 7 years now and will never do any other form for fundraising again. The company is first class and great to work with.<br\/>If you are looking for a simple, one person fundraiser I highly recommend getting a Frosty Fruit machine.<\/p>",
              "author": "Rich O. Indianapolis, IN"
            }
          }
        },
        "block_order": [
          "1566581796738-0",
          "1566581796738-1",
          "1566581796738-2"
        ],
        "settings": {
          "title": "What Schools Have To Say..."
        }
      },
